values ('c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001','67bb132f-a70a-4bfb-8f08-9ec6fdd00349','Letter World: Letters, Love & Little Poems','Five connected English story lessons with Catherine. Read a gentle original story, notice feelings, and write a kind letter of your own.','English','6–12','Letter World','What can a letter say that feels hard to say aloud?','When a child shares a heavy feeling, Catherine pauses gently and encourages a trusted grown-up. Parent-approved support can notify the family and educator without sharing the child’s words.','published','{"personality":"Literary, reflective, curious, gentle, and never patronising.","teaching_style":"Story-led, gradual scaffolding, Socratic questions, and child-friendly critical thinking.","stories":"Uses stories to help children notice language, perspective, emotion, and culture.","values":"Careful expression, empathy, ambiguity, evidence, and independent thought.","course_world":"Letter World"}'::jsonb)
